WEBVTT

00:02:26.018 --> 00:02:30.448
Shakespeare uses melancholic monologues
to breathtaking effect.

00:02:30.448 --> 00:02:35.858
This is perhaps best exemplified in 
Hamlet’s most famous declaration of angst:

00:02:35.858 --> 00:02:43.078
"To be or not to be—that is the question:

00:02:43.078 --> 00:02:46.658
Whether ’tis nobler in the mind to suffer

00:02:46.658 --> 00:02:51.688
The slings and arrows 
of outrageous fortune,

00:02:51.688 --> 00:02:56.202
Or to take arms against a sea of troubles

00:02:56.202 --> 00:03:00.992
And, by opposing, end them."